  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/ed/505",
  "definition": "Applicant, Employer, and Mentor Responsibilities for Timely Review and Processing by the Department",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-02-22",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Ed 505) #13101, eff 10-5-20; amd by #13167, INTERIM, eff 2-16-21, EXPIRED: 8-15-21 in paragraph (d); ss by#13303, eff 12-10-21 New. #13562, eff 2-22-23 (formerly Ed 505.09)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
